#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:311
msgid ""
"Automatic AP conversion requires plain Ethernet ports. Configure VLAN or "
"switch topologies manually."
msgstr "自动 AP 转换适用于普通以太网端口，VLAN 或传统交换机拓扑请手动配置。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:304
msgid ""
"Cannot identify the Ethernet WAN device. Configure LAN/WAN devices first."
msgstr "无法确定有线 WAN 设备，请先配置 LAN/WAN 设备。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:302
msgid "Cannot read board port assignments. Configure AP ports manually."
msgstr "无法读取板级网口配置，请手动配置 AP 网口。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:563
msgid ""
"Manual changes are preserved. Concurrent edits to the same settings or "
"incompatible device assignments stop the switch."
msgstr "保留手动修改；同时修改同一设置或设备分配冲突时会停止切换。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:562
msgid ""
"Manually enable to bridge all Ethernet ports and obtain IPv4/IPv6 from the "
"upstream router; disable to restore the previous settings. When disabled, "
"PPPoE automatically uses main-router mode and other WAN protocols use sub-"
"router mode."
msgstr ""
"手动启用后将全部网口桥接，从上级获取 IPv4/IPv6；取消后恢复之前的设置。未启用"
"时，PPPoE 自动采用主路由模式，其他 WAN 协议采用子路由模式。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:141
msgid "Mode switch refused: ambiguous matching configuration sections:"
msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下配置节存在多个匹配项："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:215
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: an AP snapshot exists while AP mode is disabled. "
"Restore AP mode and use LuCI to switch back."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：AP 模式已关闭但仍有 AP 快照，请恢复 AP 模式后通过 LuCI 关闭。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:218
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: configuration changed while this page was open. Reload "
"the page."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：打开页面后设备配置已发生变化，请刷新页面。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:146
msgid "Mode switch refused: reserved section already exists at"
msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下保留配置节已存在："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:194
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: saved configuration snapshot is missing or invalid."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：配置快照缺失或无效。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:131
msgid "Mode switch refused: section type changed at"
msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下配置节的类型已改变："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:490
msgid ""
"Mode switch refused: the active WAN device is still part of the LAN bridge. "
"Review device assignments."
msgstr "已停止模式切换：启用的 WAN 设备仍在 LAN 网桥中，请检查设备分配。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:207
#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:243
msgid "Mode switch refused: user changed related options:"
msgstr "已停止模式切换：以下相关选项已被用户修改："

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:383
msgid ""
"No free LAN subnet was found. Configure a non-overlapping IPv4 subnet "
"manually."
msgstr "未找到可用 LAN 网段，请手动设置与上级不重叠的 IPv4 网段。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-router-tool.json:3
msgid "Read Ethernet port assignments and router tool presets"
msgstr "读取以太网端口分配与路由器工具预设"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-router-tool/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-tool.js:561
msgid "Relay AP mode"
msgstr "中继AP模式"
